(text "25 MHz HCMOS XO - ECS-2520MV-250-BN-TR, 1.6-3.6 V, +/-50 ppm (-40..85 C), IDD <= 7 mA @3.3 V, load <= 15 pF\n100 nF at pin 4, 10k OE pull-up (OE high/open = run), 27R series termination at pin 3 (Z0 50 ohm).\nTypical use: Ethernet PHY / switch ref. Rename VDD / OE / CLK labels to your nets." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 76.20 90.20 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4f39224-ae8d-4ebb-8678-81543b0d2c50"))
